cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ecg-glucose-benchmark: analysis code, pre-specified protocols and aggregate results for detecting hypo- and hyperglycemia from inpatient 12-lead ECGs"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, aggregate results and analysis-plan excerpt for a study of hypoglycemia and severe hyperglycemia
  detection from inpatient 12-lead ECGs in MIMIC-IV-Ext-ECG-Glucose v1.0.0: demographics, ECG machine measurements,
  a CNN trained from scratch, and frozen ECG foundation models with a linear probe, with a pre-specified test of
  pretraining contamination. No data from the credentialed dataset are included.
type: software
license: MIT
